{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.poster.avif?t=1768439998\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.webm?t=1768439998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/bf83889fd202cc26949c19051d5396e6.mp4?t=1768439998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive with your fluffy companions!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FuwaFuwa Survivors</strong> is a survivor-like action roguelike game that features buildcraft with fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control adorable animals and fight off swarming enemies in tight <strong>15-minute</strong> runs, then take down powerful bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level up during battle to <strong>evolve skills</strong>, combine them with the <strong>enchantment system</strong>, and forge your own unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/1f1fbe415bcf1abe7d9611df2aee74ea.avif?t=1768439998\" width=600 height=117 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, horde-clearing combat:</strong> hundreds\u2014then thousands\u2014of enemies for pure mow-down fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043830/extras/70b382a832e16bfd38a486139e95a275.avif?t=1